{"name": "Tavern Rivals", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras_big/7eb929216e24a9f44278ff8ce639e8e6.webp?t=1789607312\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/7eb929216e24a9f44278ff8ce639e8e6.avif?t=1789607312\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"692\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/5f4ffe211b2426164aa39aad0acd108a.poster.avif?t=1789607312\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/5f4ffe211b2426164aa39aad0acd108a.webm?t=1789607312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/5f4ffe211b2426164aa39aad0acd108a.mp4?t=1789607312\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras_big/e96e32bfe2492ec5ebe03bba0378378d.webp?t=1789607312\" height=\"268\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/e96e32bfe2492ec5ebe03bba0378378d.avif?t=1789607312\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your gold each round, none of it carries over. Buy and combine powerful minions, then level up for another board slot and better odds on the rare minions. Discover trinkets, each one bends a rule the rest of your run plays around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"692\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/f2c1dc9499553a2be819b773dcac125b.poster.avif?t=1789607312\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/f2c1dc9499553a2be819b773dcac125b.webm?t=1789607312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/f2c1dc9499553a2be819b773dcac125b.mp4?t=1789607312\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras_big/a7d2bbaa0c0d3982555a1b0e28370b2f.webp?t=1789607312\" height=\"268\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/a7d2bbaa0c0d3982555a1b0e28370b2f.avif?t=1789607312\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A minion's faction says what it scales, not who can use it. Every one of them does something on any board. Commit to a single faction and push it as far as it goes, or draft a bridge minion: it runs on one faction's engine and pays out in another's, making two halves into one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"692\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/0015cc7d475d3e7c3900cf7c144f598b.poster.avif?t=1789607312\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/0015cc7d475d3e7c3900cf7c144f598b.webm?t=1789607312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/0015cc7d475d3e7c3900cf7c144f598b.mp4?t=1789607312\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras_big/3b69ceafa72bf61245c3ec486552c2a3.webp?t=1789607312\" height=\"268\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/3b69ceafa72bf61245c3ec486552c2a3.avif?t=1789607312\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every gold spent, every merge, every trinket, every faction call \u2014 it all comes down to one row you can no longer touch. Placement locks, nothing moves, and every synergy on the field is standing on a body that can die. Build an engine that takes your opponents apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"692\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/a42c897c596a1b7d79241bacc1b82ad5.poster.avif?t=1789607312\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/a42c897c596a1b7d79241bacc1b82ad5.webm?t=1789607312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/extras/a42c897c596a1b7d79241bacc1b82ad5.mp4?t=1789607312\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Asynchronous PvP Auto Battler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast runs that take between 15min - 45min</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deeply synergistic combos, open to be interrupted in unique ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Champion mode, compete to become the\u00a0Grand Champion</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Tavern Rivals is a synergy-heavy PvP auto battler where every synergy has a body holding it up. No team health bar, on either side \u2014 so protect the minions your engine runs on, and go through the ones holding theirs together.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5186450/23e7674a12aa2263380b831bf2978a0af74f02b5/header.jpg?t=1789607312", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Auto Battler", "Card Game", "Card Battler", "Roguelite", "2D"], "developers": "Buncha Bits", "publishers": "Buncha Bits", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5186450", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "16 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/b8PlmtddYdE", "first_seen": 1789509600.0, "review_rank": 38}